sequenceDiagram
  participant Sensor
  participant ML
  participant Rules
  participant Room
  participant Outbox
  participant Firebase
  participant Actuator
  participant BLE
  participant UI
  Sensor->>ML: window of 20 samples
  ML-->>Rules: class and confidence
  Sensor-->>Rules: axes and intensity
  Sensor->>Room: persist sample
  Rules->>Rules: consecutive matches, edge, cooldown
  Rules->>Room: atomic execution and gated outbox with eventId
  Room-->>Rules: durable commit
  Rules->>Actuator: request allowed action
  Rules->>BLE: send ALERT with eventId
  BLE-->>Rules: ACK with eventId and revision
  Rules->>Room: finalize actual outcomes and payload atomically
  Room->>Outbox: ready true
  Outbox->>Firebase: idempotent write by eventId
  Firebase-->>Room: ACK then local SYNCED
  Room-->>UI: recent records and executions
  Cloud-->>UI: sync state
  BLE-->>UI: connection and acknowledgement
